    <p class="clause">We are pleased to offer you a place on the <strong>Learning-Based Internship Programme</strong> at ${Ie.name}${s.position?` as <strong>${s.position}</strong>`:""} in the <strong>${s.department}</strong> department${s.internFocusArea?`, focusing on <strong>${s.internFocusArea}</strong>`:""}${s.internInstitution?`. This placement is in connection with your studies at <strong>${s.internInstitution}</strong>${s.internProgramme?` (${s.internProgramme})`:""}`:""}.</p>

